{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33206","headline":"题文翁石室 · 裴鉶","name":"题文翁石室","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文翁石室有仪形，庠序千秋播德馨。\n古柏尚留今日翠，高岷犹蔼旧时青。\n人心未肯抛羶蚁，弟子依前学聚萤。\n更叹沱江无限水，争流祗愿到沧溟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴鉶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}